test "rank1709: (f) the load in a helper method of the same defaulting class is the same weakness"
  lang python
  file src/sagemaker/base_deserializers.py
  expect VYQL-DESER-023
  expect_review code.UnrestrictedClassDeserialization
  code
  ```
  import io

  import numpy as np


  class NumpyDeserializer:
      def __init__(self, dtype=None, accept="application/x-npy", allow_pickle=True):
          self.dtype = dtype
          self.allow_pickle = allow_pickle

      def _load_npy(self, stream):
          return np.load(io.BytesIO(stream.read()), allow_pickle=self.allow_pickle)

      def deserialize(self, stream, content_type):
          return self._load_npy(stream)
  ```

