  reject_review code.UnrestrictedClassDeserialization
  code
  ```
  import io

  import numpy as np


  class LegacyDeserializer:
      def __init__(self, dtype=None, allow_pickle=True):
          self.allow_pickle = allow_pickle


  class SafeNumpyDeserializer:
      def __init__(self, dtype=None, accept="application/x-npy", allow_pickle=False):
          self.allow_pickle = allow_pickle

      def deserialize(self, stream, content_type):
          return np.load(io.BytesIO(stream.read()), allow_pickle=self.allow_pickle)
  ```

test "rank1709: (h) a defaulting wrapper that only ever calls np.loadtxt stays quiet -- the callee match is exact"
  lang python
  file src/sagemaker/base_deserializers.py
  reject VYQL-DESER-023
  reject_review code.UnrestrictedClassDeserialization
  code
  ```
  import io

  import numpy as np


  class NumpyDeserializer:
      def __init__(self, dtype=None, accept="text/csv", allow_pickle=True):
          self.dtype = dtype
          self.allow_pickle = allow_pickle

      def deserialize(self, stream, content_type):
          return np.loadtxt(io.TextIOWrapper(stream), allow_pickle=self.allow_pickle)
  ```
